[en.IDEA_C08_STARLIGHT_RADIO_01]
Starlight Radio

[en.IDEA_C08_STARLIGHT_RADIO_01_desc]
The Starlight Radio, enhanced by magic engineering, is an important communication tool for the resistance organization. It has functions such as external propaganda, diplomatic liaison, and military communication. It cannot be received by ordinary radios, and can interfere with and intercept the frequency bands of other radios.

[zh.IDEA_C08_STARLIGHT_RADIO_01]
星光电台

[zh.IDEA_C08_STARLIGHT_RADIO_01_desc]
经由魔法学工程加持的星光电台是抵抗组织的重要联络工具，其具有对外宣传，外交联络及军事通信等功能，无法用一般的电台接收，同时能干扰及拦截其他电台的频段。
